<title>AUSTRIA: Austria to tender 20 bln ATS 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Austria to tender 20 bln ATS 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Kontrollbank, the Austrian government's financing agent, on Monday.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Austria</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 20 billion ATS</p>
<p>MATURITY: 11 April 2007</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: 8 April 1997</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
